 <metadata>
  <name>ADO -&gt; K2 -&gt; Cool OAB</name>
  <desc>The full send. From Overlook, wrap Robie Point, descend to No Hands, climb K2, and keep going. Tag Cool, then reverse the route: back down to No Hands, back through Robie, and finish at Overlook. It’s smooth singletrack, big exposure, one nasty climb, and some of the best trails in Auburn.</desc>
  <author>
   <name>Brandon Costa</name>
   <link href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/778990"/>
  </author>
  <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors">
   <year>2020</year>
   <license>https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright</license>
  </copyright>
  <link href="https://www.strava.com/routes/3363933031595008632"/>
 </metadata>
